            "items": {
              "type": "string",
            },
            "type": "array",
          },
          "positive_styles": {
            "description": "The styles and musical directions that should be present in this chunk. Use English language for best results. 
The styles for the first chunk are the most important as they set the overall tone and genre. Styles for subsequent chunks can be used to add nuance, progression, emphasis, or change the direction of the song. Aim to have at least 6-7 styles in early chunks until the direction is established. Generic styles like \`great production quality\` are good default styles to append to the list.",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
            },
            "type": "array",
          },
          "text": {
