    "/v1/mtxx/versatile_hairstyle": {
      "post": {
        "description": "
Versatile Hairstyle is a hairstyle that can be adapted to different occasions and styles.

<details>
	<summary>Example</summary>

| Original Image | Result Image |
|----------------|--------------------|
| ![Original Image](https://assets.itsrose.net/public-resource/girl-in-red-dress.jpg) | ![Versatile Hairstyle](https://assets.itsrose.net/public-resource/girl-in-red-dress_hair_type_0.jpg) |
| **Original** | **Hair type 0** |

</details>

<details>
	<summary>Hair types</summary>
<table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;table-layout:fixed;">
  <tr>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>0</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>1</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>2</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>3</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>4</code></th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-32-50.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 0" />
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-33-15.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 1" />
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-33-35.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 2" />
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-34-1.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 3" />
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-30-40.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 4" />
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>5</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>6</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>7</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>8</code></th>
    <th style="text-align:center;padding:4px 2px;font-size:max(12px, 1vw);word-break:break-word;"><code>9</code></th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-27-44.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 5" />
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-34-50.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 6" />
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:center;padding:4px;">
      <img src="https://obs-large.mtlab.meitu.com/public/resources/image2022-8-1_16-28-28.png" style="width:100%;max-width:120px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" alt="hair_type 7" />
